@startuml
title GaussLegendre4 complete-step lifecycle

skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Notebook
component SimulationRequest
component InitialValueProblem
component GaussLegendre4
component "Two coupled stages" as Stages
component "Batched Newton\nN x (4 x 4)" as Newton
component "GaussLegendre4IntegrationStep" as Observation
component "GC ideal-root tangent" as Tangent
component "Finite-difference map audit" as Audit
component Solution

Notebook --> InitialValueProblem
Notebook --> SimulationRequest
Notebook --> GaussLegendre4
InitialValueProblem --> GaussLegendre4 : dynamics and physical state
SimulationRequest --> GaussLegendre4 : main grid and output times
GaussLegendre4 --> Stages : predictor Z1, Z2
Stages --> Newton : unconverged R1, R2; then J1, J2
Newton --> Stages : correction
Stages --> GaussLegendre4 : converged fields
GaussLegendre4 --> Observation : main steps only
Observation --> Tangent : implicit differentiation
Observation --> Audit : sparse map_state differences
GaussLegendre4 --> Solution : physical history, Newton work, optional k

note bottom of Tangent
  D Phi = I + h/2 (J1 S1 + J2 S2)
end note

@enduml
